From cdd717bdeb5b2eb2300f9143b59f47af086171c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: leow149 <leow149@lucidmail.xyz>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:21:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 020/100] dt-bindings: display: sun4i: Add the A100 TCON LCD,
 TCON TOP and DE2 mixer

Add A100 compatibles for the LCD TCON, the TCON TOP (no TV/HDMI path, but
a gated MIPI DSI clock) and the first DE2 mixer. As for the rest of the
SoC, the A100 name covers the A133, which is a package of the same die.

The TCON TOP ports 4 and 5 (the TV and HDMI paths) move from the global
required list into the per-SoC blocks, as the A100 has neither; the other
SoCs still require them as before. Only mixer 0 is described: the second
mixer of the display engine is not supported yet.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: leow149 <leow149@lucidmail.xyz>
---
 .../display/allwinner,sun4i-a10-tcon.yaml     |  1 +
 .../allwinner,sun8i-a83t-de2-mixer.yaml       |  1 +
 .../display/allwinner,sun8i-r40-tcon-top.yaml | 37 ++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 37 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/allwinner,sun4i-a10-tcon.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/allwinner,sun4i-a10-tcon.yaml
index 724d93b91..f9738b426 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/allwinner,sun4i-a10-tcon.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/allwinner,sun4i-a10-tcon.yaml
@@ -45,6 +45,7 @@ properties:
